{
 "name": "lsratio_lc",
 "hypothesis": "H-LSRATIO-LC",
 "statement": "The frozen H-LSRATIO contrarian oi_crowd signal (L = 4 h, H = 8 h) executed on Lighter (0 bp taker for standard accounts) earns more than its Lighter spread + funding costs.",
 "post_hoc_caveat": "SELECTED POST-HOC. This config and venue were chosen after seeing H-LSRATIO's train (+13.3 bp/trade gross, n = 5,463) and validation (+10.5 bp gross, n = 1,625) results, where it failed at 13 bp taker cost. The historical splits cannot validate it; any historical recompute (evidence_lsratio_lc_posthoc_20261005.json) is informational. Only this forward test, on decisions after frozen_at, can.",
 "parent": "H-LSRATIO (reports/failures/agent_lsratio.md, reports/hypotheses/lsratio_preregistration.json)",
 "params": {
  "signal": "oi_crowd",
  "L_hours": 4,
  "H_hours": 8,
  "z_open_interest_min": 1.5,
  "z_crowd_abs_min": 1.5,
  "z_window_hours": 168,
  "z_min_values": 120,
  "stop": 0.05,
  "notional_usd": 1000
 },
 "trade_rules": "Entry at the open of the 1h kline starting at t. Exit at the open of the kline starting at t + H h (if missing: last available close before it). One open position per symbol per config: signals while a position is open are ignored. No limit on concurrent positions across symbols; each trade is one unit of notional.",
 "signal_definition": {
  "notation": "For a metric X, at hourly decision time t: dX_L(t) = ln X(t) - ln X(t - L h), using the point-in-time hourly samples. z(v)(t) = (v(t) - mean(v)) / std(v) where mean and std are over the hourly values of v at times in [t - 168 h, t - 1 h] (trailing only, current excluded), requiring >= 120 valid values.",
  "C": "count_long_short_ratio (global/crowd account ratio)",
  "T": "sum_toptrader_long_short_ratio (top-trader position ratio)",
  "OI": "sum_open_interest (contracts)",
  "div": "zD = z(dC_L - dT_L). Short if zD >= 2.0; long if zD <= -2.0 (crowd got longer than top traders -> fade the crowd).",
  "oi_crowd": "zO = z(dOI_L), zC = z(dC_L). Short if zO >= 1.5 and zC >= 1.5; long if zO >= 1.5 and zC <= -1.5 (OI jump driven by a crowd tilt -> fade the crowd)."
 },
 "point_in_time": "A metrics row with create_time T is treated as known only at T + 5 min. Hourly decision at t (top of the UTC hour) uses the row with create_time = t - 5 min; if absent, the latest row with create_time in [t - 30 min, t - 5 min]; else no decision for that symbol-hour. Universe on day d uses daily bars d-30..d-1 only. Prices for entry are the open of the 1h kline starting at t (after all inputs are known).",
 "universe_rule": "Forward universe rule (declared before any forward scoring):\n    HL-listed names (data/raw/web/hyperliquid/meta.json, fetched 2026-10) mapped to Binance USDT perps as in\n    H-LSRATIO (kNAME -> 1000NAMEUSDT, else NAMEUSDT; same exclusions); ranked by the sum of Binance quote volume\n    over the 30 daily bars of UNIVERSE_MONTH (>= 25 bars); top 30; keep those whose Binance base (symbol minus\n    USDT) is an active Lighter perp of the same name whose mark price is within 15% of the latest archived\n    Binance daily close (name-collision guard).\n    Fixed for the whole forward test.",
